# CROSSING END — on the far side of The Long Crossing, before the arena.

letterbox on
camera leader 1.8
wait 0.3
say mafia "We made it. Together."
emote fairy "!"
say fairy "Told you. The portals are the problem. Not fairies. Not you."
say mafia "Then whoever's opening them is the one I'm after."
say fairy "The Rift. That's what we call it."
